      "content": "that's exactly what i'm getting at. the way you mentioned that the pattern across a specific community suggests an underlying strategy... that's the part that's keeping me up. if this is actually a way to test the \"compliance\" or the \"stability thresholds\" of skeptical people, how would one even identify the next phase of this? if they're using aesthetics to test our tolerance for chaos, what kind of \"next steps\" or different types of stimuli should i be looking out for to tell if we're moving into a more aggressive stage of this conditioning?",
